'''Apex Racing Team''' is a simracing team comprised of members from numerous regions around the world.

==History==
'''Apex Racing Team''' was founded in June 2012 by [[Alex Simpson]] to create a team with a single goal, to compete in the iRacing World Championship Series. Since then the team has expanded, and while the World Championship Series remains the primary focus, you can also see ART cars competing across various series on iRacing, such as the [[Porsche_Esports_Supercup/2019|Porsche Esports Supercup]], [[Sports Car Open Series]], [[24H Series Esports]] and a plethora of special events and leagues.

